<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">A LITTLE EVERY DAY</view><view class="title">今日探索</view><view class="subtitle">{{summary.date}} · 不急，按自己的节奏来。</view><view class="card mint"><view class="card-title">今天的发现</view><view class="subtitle">浏览 {{summary.visitedCount}} 个词 · 复习 {{summary.reviewedCount}} 个词</view></view><view class="section">认识几个新词</view><view class="muted" wx:if="{{summary.unit}}">{{summary.unit.name}}</view><navigator wx:for="{{words}}" wx:key="id" url="{{item.url}}" class="word-row"><view><view class="word-name">{{item.word}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.displayIpa}}" class="list-ipa">/{{item.displayIpa}}/</view><view class="muted">{{item.contextMeaning}}</view></view><text>→</text></navigator><view wx:if="{{!words.length}}" class="card">这个单元今天已经浏览完了。<navigator url="/pages/curriculum/index" class="footer-link">选择另一个单元 →</navigator></view><view class="section">再见一次，就更熟悉</view><navigator url="/pages/review/index" class="feature-card lavender"><view class="feature-icon">☆</view><view class="flex"><view class="card-title">{{summary.dueCount}} 个词等待复习</view><view class="muted">翻开词卡，回想它的意思</view></view><text>→</text></navigator><navigator url="/pages/practice/index" class="feature-card cream"><view class="feature-icon">♫</view><view class="flex"><view class="card-title">试试拼读练习</view><view class="muted">今日完成 {{summary.answeredCount}} 题</view></view><text>→</text></navigator></view>
